# DESIGN.md — design contract (single source of truth)

Dev URL: http://localhost:3000

## Direction
One sentence naming the aesthetic and why it fits this product and its
users. (e.g. "Instrument-panel editorial: dense, engineered, quietly
confident — because compliance officers trust precision, not delight.")

## Tokens

### Color (4-6 named values — these are the ONLY colors allowed)
- --ink:        #______   (primary text)
- --surface:    #______   (page background)
- --surface-2:  #______   (raised/card background)
- --accent:     #______   (interactive + signature moments only)
- --line:       #______   (borders, dividers)
- --warn:       #______   (destructive/error only)

### Type
- Display: ______ — used for: page titles, the signature element. Nowhere else.
- Body:    ______ — weights: ___/___
- Utility: ______ — captions, data, labels
- Scale: 12 / 14 / 16 / 20 / 28 / 40 (adjust, then never deviate)

### Space
- Scale: 4 / 8 / 12 / 16 / 24 / 32 / 48 / 64 — no off-scale values.

### Shape & depth
- Radius: ___px (one value; exceptions listed here or they don't exist)
- Shadow: define 1-2 elevations max, as exact CSS values.

## Motion
- What animates, when, and why. Durations and easing named here.
- prefers-reduced-motion: everything above becomes opacity-only or none.

## Signature element
The one memorable thing this product's UI is recognized by. Describe it
concretely enough to build and to review against.

## Banned
- Fonts: Inter, Roboto, Arial, Space Grotesk (unless named above)
- Purple/blue gradient heroes; big-stat-with-gradient-accent template
- Hardcoded hex anywhere outside this file / the token layer
- Decorative animation with no information role
- Any color, font, spacing, or radius not defined above

## Quality floor (non-negotiable, never announced)
- Responsive to 375px, no overflow; touch targets >= 44px
- Visible keyboard focus on every interactive element
- Body contrast >= 4.5:1; reduced motion respected
- Console clean
